Package: euromillions
Architecture: all
Depends: bash (>= 4), coreutils (>= 8.22), gettext, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: locales
Description: draw EuroMillions grids from the terminal
 A small Bash script that draws five numbers from 1 to 50 and two stars
 from 1 to 12, sorted, with an optional colour output and translations
 through GNU gettext.
